<title>UK: Merrill adds $70 million to seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Merrill adds $70 million to seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it has launched for itself a $70 million tranche, priced at 99.86, of its October 2003 FRN.</p>
<p>The total size is now $250 million.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT	  $70 MLN   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    10.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.80     FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.80     PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
